    <div class="intro">
      <h3 style="color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;">🎿 Day 11 Overview</h3>
      <p>Tuesday delivers a spectacular mid-Games programme with ten medal events. The men's giant slalom brings two dramatic runs on the Stelvio in Bormio, the biathlon women's 15km individual tests marksmanship and endurance at altitude in Anterselva, the snowboard men's halfpipe final lights up Livigno, skeleton men's crown their champion at Cesana, the luge team relay adds a thrilling multi-nation format, short track women's 1000m decides gold in Milan, speed skating women's 1000m showcases sprint endurance, and freestyle skiing slopestyle qualification begins. Ice dance and the curling round robin continue the drama.</p>
    </div>

