      <ul>
        <li>Men's Giant Slalom — two-run technical battle on the Stelvio in Bormio</li>
        <li>Biathlon Women's 15km Individual — the ultimate test of shooting and skiing</li>
        <li>Snowboard Men's Halfpipe Final — aerial wizardry at Livigno</li>
        <li>Skeleton Men's Final (Runs 3 &amp; 4) at Cesana</li>
        <li>Luge Team Relay — multi-nation sprint relay on the Pariol track</li>
        <li>Short Track Women's 1000m Final — gold medal sprint in Milan</li>
        <li>Speed Skating Women's 1000m — sprint endurance at Barentsburg Arena</li>
        <li>Cross-Country Men's &amp; Women's Team Sprint Free — dual-format excitement</li>
        <li>Figure Skating Ice Dance — Rhythm Dance at Milano Forum</li>
        <li>Freestyle Skiing Women's Slopestyle Qualification at Livigno</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

